WEBVTT

00:14:54.997 --> 00:15:00.848
For me, art is not about objects of high monetary exchange.

00:15:00.848 --> 00:15:06.253
It's about reasserting our firsthand experience

00:15:06.253 --> 00:15:09.144
in present time.

00:15:09.144 --> 00:15:12.585
As John Cage said,

00:15:12.585 --> 00:15:17.672
"We are not moving towards some kind of goal.

00:15:17.672 --> 00:15:22.353
We are at the goal, and it is changing with us.

00:15:22.353 --> 00:15:28.789
If art has any purpose, it is to open our eyes to that fact."

00:15:28.789 --> 00:15:30.826
Thank you very much.